---
pageType: page
title: "Get Your Cash Offer | Written Offer in 24 Hours | Monthaven"
description: "Start your cash offer. Tell us the property address and we'll send a written, no-obligation offer within 24 hours. Gaston, Cleveland and Lincoln County NC."
robots: "noindex, follow"
breadcrumbs:
  - name: "Home"
    url: "/"
  - name: "Get My Cash Offer"
    url: "/get-offer/"
---
{% from "components/lead-form.njk" import leadForm with context %}
{% import "components/blocks.njk" as b with context %}

<section class="hero">
  <div class="wrap hero__grid">
    <div>
      <h1>Get your cash offer</h1>
      <p class="hero__sub">
        Start with the address. You'll have a written offer within {{ site.offerWindowHours }} hours.
      </p>
      <ul class="hero__points">
        <li>Free, with no obligation to accept</li>
        <li>No repairs, no cleaning, no showings</li>
        <li>No commission and no closing costs</li>
        <li>You pick the closing date</li>
        <li>We'll tell you honestly if listing would net you more</li>
      </ul>
      <p class="hero__trust">
        Rather talk to a person? Call or text
        <a href="tel:{{ site.phoneRaw }}" style="color:#fff"><strong>{{ site.phoneDisplay }}</strong></a>.
        {{ site.businessHours }}.
      </p>
    </div>
    <div>
      {{ leadForm("offer-form", "full", null, null, "Tell us about the property", "Takes about two minutes.", true) }}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section section--soft">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-5">What we'll put in writing</h2>
    {{ b.guarantee() }}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap--narrow">
    <h2 class="mb-6">What happens after you hit send</h2>
    {{ b.howItWorks() }}
  </div>
</section>
